# SPC of a negative n and TAB of one below 1 are Illegal function call (the IBM manual's pp. 327 and 340 give SPC 0-255 and TAB 1-255; a default of the IBM spec's fix-up, C-2 item 19, for the owner's veto); the 1983 source takes them as 0, and PC-BASIC goes on to the next print zone (TAB(0) a new line in both)
